# The names read off `row` are the keys of the literal in `make`, so the front end writes that layout as what is expected. Link says of the layout that its objects stay with compiled code, and the
# row comes out of a parse: the test could never pass, every row failed it and left the typed copy. The layout is not tested for there. The row stays shaped like it: what is read off it under a name
# is expected to be of the kind that the layout's field holds, so the products in `area`, copied in line, ask for numbers in both copies of the loop, and `row.name + from` asks for a text, not for a number because a number stands beside it. A read that stays generic says that its receiver is no object of compiled code, so that its stub asks the structure first. In `Pair` the names are those of its own instances; with that layout gone the empty literal that
# stands in for a missing pair is no guess either, for it answers none of the names: the reads stay one operation each and the instance still falls away.
# f1 = Pair, f2 = total, f3 = areas, f4 = labels, f5 = firsts
# RUN(COUNT): compile UnescapedShapesDroppedFromSpeculations mechanisms=all
# COUNT-NOT: statistic UnescapedShapesDroppedFromSpeculations 0
# RUN(PARSED): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# PARSED-LABEL: code f2:Body
# PARSED-NOT: = ShapeTest
# PARSED: = PropGet {{*}}key="x"
# PARSED: testedType=number
# PARSED-NOT: = ShapeTest
# RUN(KINDS): walk f3 mechanisms=all
# KINDS-LABEL: code f3:Body
# KINDS-NOT: = ShapeTest
# KINDS: = Mul {{*}}form=Numbers
# KINDS: = Mul {{*}}form=Numbers
# KINDS: = Mul {{*}}form=Numbers
# KINDS: = Mul {{*}}form=Numbers
# KINDS-NOT: = ShapeTest
# RUN(TEXT): walk f4 mechanisms=all
# TEXT-LABEL: code f4:Body
# TEXT: = PropGet {{*}}key="name" [receiverIsNoObjectOfCompiledCode]
# TEXT: testedType=string
# TEXT: = Strcat
# RUN(STUB): bytes f4:Body mechanisms=all
# STUB-NOT: Stub ReadAtSite.Of
# STUB: Stub ReadAtSiteAskingStructureFirst.OfAnyValue
# STUB-NOT: Stub ReadAtSite.Of
# RUN(LITERAL): walk f5 mechanisms=all
# LITERAL-LABEL: code f5:Body
# LITERAL-NOT: = ShapeTest
# LITERAL: = PropGet {{*}}key="a"
# LITERAL-NOT: = PutSlotOrAdd
